\p{
    See my latest on [hash functions in Bitcoin and Ethereum](dhsorens-004D) — what each chain actually hashes with, and why the Ethereum Foundation abandoned [Poseidon](dhsorens-004H) for L1 in August 2026, which was not a break of Poseidon but a change on the proving side. The systematic study behind it is [zkVMs and SNARKs](dhsorens-002C).
